6539 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Problem\072 Imagine looking for CEOs in the US but not Texas\054 who gave \04450k to education but not to Harvard\056 A normal question for a fundraiser\054 and unbuildable in the product\056 AND\057OR\057NOT existed only on a handful of filters\056\nThree of the four legacy brands being consolidated into Altrata had a version of boolean search\054 built badly\056 Users wouldn\047t migrate without it\056\nThe ticket scoped boolean to location filters only\056 I pushed for solving it across all of them\054 and executed it\056)
     /K [ 5 ]
     /P 6540 0 R
     /Pg 6529 0 R
     /S /Span
